+# Mail application
+## Register
+Product UI: a Gmail-inspired local email client for a creative professional.
+## Purpose
+Make reading, finding, organizing, and composing email fast and dependable. Seeded local data never contacts an external mailbox.
+## Principles
+Familiar navigation, dense but breathable rows, consistent state, undoable actions, persistent drafts, keyboard accessibility, and mobile parity.
